      "end_time": 4.925,
      "duration": 3.45,
      "phoneme_count": 43
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "At the end of a harrowing, hourlong interview about life in the besieged Sudanese city of El Fasher, where he spoke via a rare satellite internet connection, he asked to switch on his camera.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 34,
      "start_time": 4.925,
      "end_time": 18.075,
      "duration": 13.15,
      "phoneme_count": 194
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "An exhausted, war-weary face appeared, then broke into an enormous grin.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 18.075,
      "end_time": 23.775,
      "duration": 5.7,
      "phoneme_count": 72
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "\u201cThis is a good day for me,\u201d Dr.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 8,
      "start_time": 23.775,
      "end_time": 26.625,
      "duration": 2.85,
      "phoneme_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "Selik said, relief washing across his features. \u201cI feel like a human being again.\u201d",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 26.625,
      "end_time": 32.8,
      "duration": 6.175,
      "phoneme_count": 84
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "I found myself smiling too.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 32.8,
      "end_time": 35.375,
      "duration": 2.575,
      "phoneme_count": 29
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "That simple moment of connection was enough to provide him with fleeting relief after 500 days of horrific siege.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 35.375,
      "end_time": 43.95,
      "duration": 8.575,
      "phoneme_count": 122
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "Dr.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 1,
      "start_time": 43.95,
      "end_time": 45.425,
      "duration": 1.475,
      "phoneme_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "Selik, 43, was one of the last health workers in El Fasher, a city of a quarter-million desperate residents in the western region of Darfur, where death fell from the sky and starvation was a constant companion.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 37,
      "start_time": 45.425,
      "end_time": 60.95,
      "duration": 15.525,
      "phoneme_count": 226
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "Moments earlier, Dr.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 3,
      "start_time": 60.95,
      "end_time": 63.3,
      "duration": 2.35,
      "phoneme_count": 25
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Selik had been crying as he described how a pregnant woman had bled to death in his care for want of simple medicines.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 63.3,
      "end_time": 71.775,
      "duration": 8.475,
      "phoneme_count": 122
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "Now he tilted his camera down, inviting me to look at his lunch.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 71.775,
      "end_time": 76.7,
      "duration": 4.925,
      "phoneme_count": 67
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "I could hardly believe my eyes.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 76.7,
      "end_time": 79.4,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "phoneme_count": 29
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "He held a plate of lumpy brown mush, animal fodder normally fed to camels and cows.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 79.4,
      "end_time": 86.125,
      "duration": 6.725,
      "phoneme_count": 89
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "It had become the main source of food for most people in El Fasher, he explained \u2014 a disturbing sign of how both a doctor and the people he was trying to save had been stripped of their humanity.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 39,
